<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 31.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 31.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to East Anglia next week 83.00/82.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire next week 86.00/84.00</p>
<p>Lincolnshire next week 84.00 asa 82.00</p>
<p>Fiffe next week 90.00</p>
<p>Oxfordshire next week 85.00</p>
<p>Avon range Sep 84.00 Oct/Dec 88.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Oct/Dec 88.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Tilbury asa 74.00/75.00</p>
<p>Lincolnshire asa 76.00</p>
<p>Avon range asa 76.00/76.50</p>
</text>
